{"seq":1,"slug":"loading-plan-wms-tms-integration","title":"装载方案与 WMS/TMS 集成：装载单下发、扫码校验与执行反馈回写","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-loading-stowage-cartonization-optimization/wms-integration-loading-rate-operations/loading-plan-wms-tms-integration","wordCount":3011,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"装载方案与-wms-tms-集成-装载单下发-扫码校验与执行反馈回写\">装载方案与 WMS/TMS 集成：装载单下发、扫码校验与执行反馈回写</h1><p>一个求解器算出的 3D 装载方案，在它被打印成一张纸或推进工人手机屏幕之前，价值是零。真正把「算法」变成「箱子里真实的货」的，是装载方案与 WMS（仓储管理系统）、TMS（运输管理系统）之间的集成链路：装载单怎么下发、扫的码怎么校验、装完之后实绩怎么回写。这条链路断在任何一环，都会退化成人工口头指挥。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>装载方案的集成可拆成四个动作，构成一个闭环：<strong>下发</strong>（dispatch，把求解器排布结果编译成 WMS 能执行的<strong>装载单</strong> Loading Instruction / Stuffing List）、<strong>执行</strong>（execute，现场按单逐件装载，用手持终端 RF gun、车载屏或纸单补录）、<strong>校验</strong>（verify，每件货放入柜内指定位置前被扫码，比对「扫到的货」与「方案里的位置」）、<strong>回写</strong>（writeback，实装清单与实测体积重量、封号、时间戳写回 WMS/TMS，形成实绩并反馈修正主数据）。</p>\n<p>这四个动作不是流水线，而是一个循环：回写的差异会反过来修正包装主数据（见 <a href=\"../loading-problem-packaging-data-model/packaging-master-data-model\">包装主数据模型</a>）。装载率不是静态目标，而是这条闭环每转一圈就抬升一点的工程指标。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  O[&quot;订单 / 出货计划&lt;br/&gt;WMS&quot;] --&gt; S[&quot;3D 装箱求解器&lt;br/&gt;输出排布结果&quot;]&#10;  S --&gt; P[&quot;编译装载单&lt;br/&gt;序列 + 柜内坐标 + 约束&quot;]&#10;  P --&gt; T[&quot;下发装载任务&lt;br/&gt;WMS 波次 / TMS 派车&quot;]&#10;  T --&gt; X[&quot;现场执行&lt;br/&gt;RF 扫码 + 定位放置&quot;]&#10;  X --&gt; V{&quot;扫码校验&lt;br/&gt;货 vs 方案位置&quot;}&#10;  V --&gt;|通过| L[&quot;装载 + 采集实绩&quot;]&#10;  V --&gt;|异常| E[&quot;拦截 + 人工复核&lt;br/&gt;改配或回退&quot;]&#10;  L --&gt; W[&quot;回写实绩&lt;br/&gt;WMS / TMS&quot;]&#10;  W --&gt; M[&quot;实测装载率 + 差异分析&quot;]&#10;  M --&gt; D[&quot;修正包装主数据&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; S\">graph TD\n  O[\"订单 / 出货计划&lt;br/&gt;WMS\"] --&gt; S[\"3D 装箱求解器&lt;br/&gt;输出排布结果\"]\n  S --&gt; P[\"编译装载单&lt;br/&gt;序列 + 柜内坐标 + 约束\"]\n  P --&gt; T[\"下发装载任务&lt;br/&gt;WMS 波次 / TMS 派车\"]\n  T --&gt; X[\"现场执行&lt;br/&gt;RF 扫码 + 定位放置\"]\n  X --&gt; V{\"扫码校验&lt;br/&gt;货 vs 方案位置\"}\n  V --&gt;|通过| L[\"装载 + 采集实绩\"]\n  V --&gt;|异常| E[\"拦截 + 人工复核&lt;br/&gt;改配或回退\"]\n  L --&gt; W[\"回写实绩&lt;br/&gt;WMS / TMS\"]\n  W --&gt; M[\"实测装载率 + 差异分析\"]\n  M --&gt; D[\"修正包装主数据\"]\n  D --&gt; S</pre><h2 id=\"装载单的数据契约-从求解器输出到可执行指令\">装载单的数据契约：从求解器输出到可执行指令</h2><p>装载单不是一个「箱子在哪」的坐标列表，而是一份<strong>机器可读、现场可执行</strong>的指令契约，必须同时回答「装什么、装到哪、按什么顺序、受什么约束」。字段错误会直接变成现场事故：位置写错 → 压货；序列写错 → 后到的卸货点被压在柜底；朝向约束丢失 → 「此面朝上」的货被侧放导致漏液。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>来源系统</th>\n<th>消费方</th>\n<th>缺失/错误的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>箱号 / 柜号（ISO 6346）</td>\n<td>TMS / 订舱系统</td>\n<td>报关、装船</td>\n<td>装错柜、VGM 对不上柜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>装载序列（LIFO 顺序）</td>\n<td>求解器</td>\n<td>WMS 装载任务、现场</td>\n<td>多站点卸货顺序反了</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>柜内坐标 / 位置槽（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y,z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>求解器</td>\n<td>现场、可视化</td>\n<td>重叠、压货、重心偏移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>货件标识（SSCC 或 HU 号）</td>\n<td>WMS</td>\n<td>扫码校验</td>\n<td>无法比对实装与计划</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预期数量 / 净重 / 体积</td>\n<td>WMS 主数据</td>\n<td>校验、装载率</td>\n<td>少装、漏装无法发现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>朝向与堆叠约束</td>\n<td>包装主数据</td>\n<td>现场</td>\n<td>「不可倒置」货被倒放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>危险品等级与隔离要求</td>\n<td>主数据 / 合规</td>\n<td>现场、TMS</td>\n<td>IMDG 隔离违规被拒装</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>封号（Seal No.）</td>\n<td>现场</td>\n<td>报关、提单</td>\n<td>关封不符，查验风险</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>货件标识的行业基础是 <strong>GS1 的 SSCC</strong>（Serial Shipping Container Code，18 位数字，用应用标识符 <code>AI (00)</code> 编码，来源：GS1 General Specifications）。SSCC 是「一个物流单元唯一身份」的载体，让「方案里的第 7 号托盘」和「现场扫到的这个托盘」一一对上——没有它，扫码校验无从谈起。若仓内以托盘、笼车等更大单元流转，SSCC 挂在物流单元而非最小销售单元上，扫码粒度必须与之一致，否则会出现「扫的是箱、方案算的是托盘」的错配。</p>\n<p>容器号本身的校验位由 <strong>ISO 6346</strong> 规定：4 个字母（前 3 位是 BIC 注册的所有者代码）+ 6 位数字，字母按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=10, B=12, \\dots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span></span> 映射（跳过 11 的倍数），逐位乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mtext>position</mtext></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{\\text{position}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8305em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">position</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，求和后对 11 取模即得校验位。集成系统必须验这一位，否则一个输错的箱号会把整柜实绩挂到错误的柜上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"装载任务下发-wms-波次-拣货序列与装载序列的耦合\">装载任务下发：WMS 波次、拣货序列与装载序列的耦合</h2><p>下发环节最容易踩的坑，是把「拣货序列」当成「装载序列」。二者方向相反：<strong>拣货通常按仓储区由近及远</strong>，而<strong>多站点整柜配送的装载必须按卸货点倒序（先装的最后卸）</strong>，即 LIFO（Last-In-First-Out）。若 WMS 波次只按拣货效率排，货就在柜里堆成正序，第一个卸货点被压在最里面。</p>\n<p>所以装载单下发时，WMS 必须把求解器给出的<strong>装载序列</strong>作为装载任务的主键顺序，而非沿用拣货顺序。三种下发模式：<strong>系统指令式</strong>（按序列生成逐条 RF 任务，终端提示「装第 N 件到坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,y,z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>」，防错最强但依赖网络）、<strong>批量清单式</strong>（一次下发完整清单，现场自组织，校验只能事后做）、<strong>混合式</strong>（清单下发但危险品、高价值等关键件走强制扫码）。</p>\n<p>在报文层面，跨企业集成通常沿用既有 EDI 系谱：装载/运输指令对应 UN/EDIFACT 的 <strong>IFTMIN</strong>，出库通知对应 <strong>DESADV</strong>，船岸堆场作业有 <strong>COPRAR</strong>（装/卸船指令）、<strong>COARRI</strong>（装/卸船报告）与配载图 <strong>BAPLIE</strong>——由 UN/CEFACT 与 SMDG（Shipping Message Development Group）维护。北美零售/3PL 生态更常用 ANSI X12 的 <strong>940（Warehouse Shipping Order）</strong> 与 <strong>945（Warehouse Shipping Advice）</strong>。2026 年新建系统倾向 <strong>API-first</strong>（REST/GraphQL 推送装载单、webhook 回传执行事件），但涉及跨企业（货代、船公司、海外仓）时 EDI 报文仍是兜底通道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"扫码校验-把装载执行变成防错门\">扫码校验：把装载执行变成防错门</h2><p>扫码校验的本质，是在<strong>货物进入柜内之前</strong>用一个可自动化的动作，比对「人希望装的」与「方案要求装的」——不是事后盘点，而是<strong>准入门禁</strong>，扫不过就不该放进去。校验分三层，越往下越接近合规：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>校验层</th>\n<th>触发点</th>\n<th>比对内容</th>\n<th>失败动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>件级校验</td>\n<td>每件放入柜内</td>\n<td>SSCC/HU vs 方案位置</td>\n<td>拦截，提示正确位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数量校验</td>\n<td>装载完成</td>\n<td>实扫件数 vs 计划件数</td>\n<td>提示缺件/多件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重量/合规校验</td>\n<td>装载完成签封前</td>\n<td>累计重量 vs 轴荷/额定；危险品隔离</td>\n<td>阻断签封，触发重排</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>件级校验依赖条码质量。行业普遍使用 <strong>GS1-128</strong>（一维码）或 <strong>GS1 DataMatrix</strong>（二维码）承载 SSCC 与 AI 数据串，其中 <code>AI (00)</code> 是 SSCC、<code>AI (01)</code> 是 GTIN、<code>AI (37)</code> 是件数。DataMatrix 能在小标签上塞下更多 AI、容错更高，是近年仓储扫码主流（来源：GS1 General Specifications）。</p>\n<p>危险品的校验尤为关键：IMDG Code（国际海运危险货物规则）要求不同类别危险品之间保持<strong>隔离（segregation）</strong>，例如第 8 类腐蚀品与第 4.3 类遇水放出易燃气体的物质必须分隔。若不能在下发时把隔离规则编码进位置约束、并在扫码时校验，一次违规就可能让整柜在装船前被码头拒收。\n校验的度量口径要统一。设计划装载件集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>、实际扫码确认件集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>，则校验通过率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|P \\cap S| / |P|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣/∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>，差异率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>∖</mo><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>∖</mo><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(|P \\setminus S| + |S \\setminus P|) / |P|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∖</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∖</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>。差异率里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>∖</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P \\setminus S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∖</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是漏装（计划了但没扫到），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>∖</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S \\setminus P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∖</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 是错装（扫了不在计划里的货）。两者根因不同：漏装多是缺货或拣货错，错装多是货位或标签错——拆成两个分量才能定位是仓储作业问题还是主数据问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"执行反馈回写-实测装载率与差异闭环\">执行反馈回写：实测装载率与差异闭环</h2><p>回写内容至少包括：<strong>实装货件清单</strong>（哪些 SSCC 进了柜）、<strong>实测体积与重量</strong>（或 VGM，见 <a href=\"../weight-stability-stowage-mixed-cargo/container-weight-balance-vgm\">集装箱重量配平</a>）、<strong>封号</strong>、<strong>装柜起止时间戳</strong>、<strong>操作人</strong>；这份实绩是计算<strong>实测装载率</strong>的唯一依据。</p>\n<p>装载率有两个口径，必须分开算、分开看：体积装载率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>V</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>inner</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_V = \\sum_{i \\in S} v_i / V_{\\text{inner}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0771em;vertical-align:-0.3271em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">inner</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，重量装载率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>W</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>max</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_W = (\\sum_{i \\in S} m_i + T) / M_{\\text{max}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0771em;vertical-align:-0.3271em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">max</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为实装货件体积与净重，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>inner</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{inner}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">inner</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为柜内可用容积，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 为箱皮重，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>max</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\text{max}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">max</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为额定最大总重（MGW，见 ISO 668）。<strong>两个口径往往严重背离</strong>：轻抛货（家纺、塑料制品）体积装满了重量才用到一半，重货（瓷砖、机械件）重量顶到 MGW 时体积还剩一大半。只看一个口径会误导决策——轻抛货该用高柜争取更多容积，重货则受限于轴荷而非容积。</p>\n<p>回写的工程难点不是算数，而是<strong>一致性</strong>。装载实绩来自现场终端，网络抖动、离线补录、重复提交都会让事件乱序或重复。三条常规做法：<strong>幂等键</strong>（每条装载事件携带唯一键，重放不产生重复实绩）、<strong>事务性发件箱</strong>（WMS 在本地事务里把事件写入 outbox 表，再由独立进程投递到 TMS，避免「本地写成功、推送失败」的丢事件）、<strong>至少一次 + 对账</strong>（网络层保证 at-least-once，业务层用 reconciliation 任务定期比对 WMS 与 TMS 实绩，修补最终一致）。</p>\n<p>回写闭环真正的价值在最后一环：<strong>差异反馈修正主数据</strong>。当实测体积系统性大于主数据登记值（如卖家换了外箱却没回传），装载率会持续偏低但求解器「算得没错」——这是数据问题不是算法问题。把「实测 vs 主数据」的偏差做成报告，就能驱动包装主数据修正工单，形成从执行反哺设计的正向循环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"集成架构的运维治理\">集成架构的运维治理</h2><p>把四步落成系统，需要一组可运维的治理约定，否则集成会腐化成「谁也说不清哪条数据是真的」。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>单一真相源</strong>：装载单的所有权属于求解器/WMS、TMS 只读不写；实绩的所有权属于 WMS、TMS 消费。跨系统写同一份数据是数据冲突头号来源。</li>\n<li><strong>状态机显式化</strong>：装载任务的状态（已下发 → 执行中 → 校验通过 → 已回写 → 已对账）必须是显式状态机，迁移带事件与时间戳，避免「系统说装了、现场说没装」的黑盒。</li>\n<li><strong>可观测性</strong>：下发延迟、校验通过率、差异率、回写到达率是四个必备运行时指标，异常能第一时间暴露集成链路问题，而非等柜子到了码头才发现。</li>\n<li><strong>数据质量门</strong>：入口处校验箱号 ISO 6346 校验位、SSCC 位数、危险品编码合法性——把脏数据挡在装载单生成前，比在装载现场拦截便宜一个数量级。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这套治理追求<strong>每一环都可追溯、可对账、可回退</strong>。跨境装载的现场条件（断网、赶船期、改配）决定集成系统必须在「最优」和「可用」之间留出人工兜底通道，但兜底动作本身也要被记录。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>装载方案与 WMS/TMS 的集成，本质是把一次性的算法输出，变成一条可执行、可校验、可回写、可反哺数据的闭环链路。要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>装载单是一份数据契约，必须携带柜号、LIFO 装载序列、柜内坐标、货件标识（SSCC）、朝向与危险品约束——任何字段缺失都会变成现场事故。</li>\n<li>下发时<strong>装载序列 ≠ 拣货序列</strong>：多站点配送要按卸货点倒序装，WMS 波次必须服从求解器给出的序列；跨企业集成沿用 IFTMIN/DESADV/COPRAR/BAPLIE 等 UN/EDIFACT 报文，自有系统走 API-first。</li>\n<li>扫码校验是<strong>准入防错门</strong>，分件级、数量级、重量/合规级三层；差异率要拆成漏装与错装两个分量。</li>\n<li>回写实绩是计算实测装载率的唯一依据，体积装载率与重量装载率必须分开看；可靠回写依赖幂等键、事务性发件箱与对账。</li>\n<li>闭环的真正价值是<strong>差异反哺主数据</strong>——实测与登记的偏差驱动包装数据修正；集成链路的可运维性最终决定装载率能否一轮一轮抬上去。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"装载方案与 WMS/TMS 集成：装载单下发、扫码校验与执行反馈回写","id":"装载方案与-wms-tms-集成-装载单下发-扫码校验与执行反馈回写"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"装载单的数据契约：从求解器输出到可执行指令","id":"装载单的数据契约-从求解器输出到可执行指令"},{"level":2,"text":"装载任务下发：WMS 波次、拣货序列与装载序列的耦合","id":"装载任务下发-wms-波次-拣货序列与装载序列的耦合"},{"level":2,"text":"扫码校验：把装载执行变成防错门","id":"扫码校验-把装载执行变成防错门"},{"level":2,"text":"执行反馈回写：实测装载率与差异闭环","id":"执行反馈回写-实测装载率与差异闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"集成架构的运维治理","id":"集成架构的运维治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"混装积载与多目的地卸货顺序：LIFO 分层与 floor loading 策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-loading-stowage-cartonization-optimization/weight-stability-stowage-mixed-cargo/mixed-cargo-stowage-discharge-sequence"},"next":{"title":"装载率度量体系：体积重量利用率、CBM 口径与偏差归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-loading-stowage-cartonization-optimization/wms-integration-loading-rate-operations/loading-rate-metrics-attribution"}}